sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor G as Khách (guest reviewer)
    participant Page as page.tsx /r/[slug] (RSC)
    participant UI as GuestReviewApp (client)
    participant API as Routes /api/r/[slug]/*
    participant Auth as share-auth.ts
    participant Svc as share-decision.ts
    participant Sync as task-sync.ts
    participant DB as Prisma / Neon
    participant Mail as Resend (notifyReview, notifyGuestsOfAsset)
    participant Ing as Inngest reviewShareDecision

    G->>Page: GET /r/slug
    Page->>Auth: resolveShareGate(slug, cookies)
    Auth->>DB: shareLink.findUnique(slug) + items
    alt slug sai hoặc revokedAt
        Auth-->>Page: not_found / revoked
        Page-->>G: GateScreen unavailable (không phân biệt được)
    else expiresAt quá hạn
        Auth-->>Page: expired
        Page-->>G: GateScreen expired
    else có passwordHash, chưa unlock
        Auth-->>Page: password
        Page-->>G: PasswordGate
        G->>API: POST /api/r/slug/unlock (password)
        API->>DB: limitDb 5/60s failClosed
        alt quá rate limit
            API-->>G: 429 RATE_LIMITED
        else bcrypt.compare sai
            API-->>G: 403 FORBIDDEN Incorrect password
        else đúng
            API->>Auth: mintUnlockToken(share)
            API-->>G: 200 + cookie rv_unlock_slug (JWT HS256)
        end
    else ok
        Page->>DB: buildGuestShareContent(share)
        Page-->>G: render GuestReviewApp
    end

    Note over G,UI: Xem video qua playback-token / view-url, comment theo timecode + annotation

    G->>UI: gửi comment
    UI->>API: POST /api/r/slug/comments
    API->>DB: limitDb 10/60s và 60/3600s
    API->>Auth: requireShare rồi resolveGuestForWrite
    alt không session, không guest input, link không có client
        Auth-->>UI: 401 UNAUTHORIZED
        G->>UI: nhập name + email (IdentityModal)
        UI->>API: POST /api/r/slug/identity
        API->>Auth: createGuestSession (lưu sha256 token)
        API-->>UI: 201 + cookie rv_guest_slug
    end
    API->>DB: createGuestComment (ReviewComment, commentCount +1)
    API-->>UI: 201 comment DTO

    G->>UI: bấm Approve / Request changes
    UI->>UI: submitDecision() gọi ensureIdentity('decision')
    UI->>API: POST /api/r/slug/decision (versionId, decision, note)
    API->>DB: limitDb r decision 5/60s
    alt quá rate limit
        API-->>UI: 429 RATE_LIMITED
    end
    API->>Auth: requireShare(slug)
    alt gate fail
        Auth-->>UI: 404 SHARE_NOT_FOUND / 410 REVOKED / 410 EXPIRED / 401 PASSWORD_REQUIRED
    end
    API->>API: parseBody(guestDecisionSchema)
    alt body sai schema
        API-->>UI: 400 VALIDATION
    end
    API->>Auth: getGuestSession / createGuestSession
    alt không session và body không có guest
        API-->>UI: 401 UNAUTHORIZED Please add your name and email
    end
    API->>Svc: submitGuestDecision(share, guest, input)
    Svc->>DB: assertVersionInShare(share, versionId)
    alt version không thuộc share
        Svc-->>UI: 404 NOT_FOUND
    else asset không có taskId / task cancelled-archived / chưa ở phase khách
        Svc-->>UI: 403 DECISIONS_DISABLED
    else pipelineStatus khác READY hoặc reviewState DRAFT
        Svc-->>UI: 409 STATE_INVALID
    else hợp lệ
        Svc->>DB: tx flip reviewVersion.reviewState + reviewAsset.statusId (REVIEW_STATUS_MAP) + recordActivity
        alt thua race (updateMany count 0)
            Svc->>DB: đọc lại reviewState
            alt đã ở đúng target
                Svc-->>UI: 200 idempotent (note vẫn được lưu)
            else khác target
                Svc-->>UI: 409 STATE_INVALID trang sẽ refresh
            end
        end
        opt note của request_changes
            Svc->>DB: persistDecisionNote tạo ReviewComment (public, internal nếu allowComments=false)
        end
        opt isHead - hiệu ứng ĐỒNG BỘ (video-fix 3-4-5)
            Svc->>DB: subscribeGuestOnDecision(email, assetId)
            alt decision request_changes
                Svc->>Sync: syncTaskOnChangesRequested(taskId)
                Sync->>DB: task.status A5 sang A6 Đã nhận feedback (khách), fallback Revision + clientReview=CHANGES
                Svc->>Mail: notifyReview VIDEO_CHANGES_REQUESTED (editor + manager)
                Svc->>Mail: notifyGuestsOfAsset feedback_received (ack khách)
            else decision approve
                Svc->>DB: task.updateMany clientReview=APPROVED (guard isArchived + status cũ)
                Svc->>Mail: notifyReview VIDEO_REVIEW_APPROVED (editor + manager)
                Svc->>Mail: notifyGuestsOfAsset approved
            end
            Svc->>Ing: inngest.send review/decision.recorded
            alt gửi event lỗi
                Svc->>Svc: log share.decision.event_send_failed (khách vẫn nhận 200)
            end
        end
        API-->>UI: 200 reviewState + message (+ set cookie rv_guest nếu vừa tạo)
        UI-->>G: toast Approved / Changes requested
    end

    Note over Ing: Backup BẤT ĐỒNG BỘ, retries 4, idempotent
    Ing->>DB: step load-state (reviewState + isHead)
    alt superseded (state đã đổi hoặc không còn head)
        Ing-->>Ing: skip, log share_decision.superseded
    else còn hiệu lực
        alt request_changes
            Ing->>Sync: step sync-task-revision (no-op nếu route đã chuyển)
        else approve
            Ing->>DB: step settle-client-review (clientReview=APPROVED, guard isArchived)
        end
        Ing->>DB: step task-feed-audit (task.client_approved / task.client_changes_requested)
    end

